<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">2. Interact &amp; Connect</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Social media is meant for interactions and getting to know your customers. Q&amp;As and polls are perfect examples of bringing a brand community closer together. Sharing UGC (User-Generated Content) and customer experiences allow your audience to relate to your brand better, through the lens of another customer’s experience.</span></p>
