<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">3. Promote</span></h3>
<p><a href="https://www.marketingcharts.com/digital/social-media-113405"><span style="font-weight: 400;">40% of consumers</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> do want to hear about promotions and deals on social media! Flash deals, giveaways and partnerships add value for your customers, so use your platform to share it. Giveaways can be a great way to grow your audience too.</span></p>
