<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">4. Inspire</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Design-led industries can benefit from beautiful visuals to promote their business for both products and services. There are many ways to approach it, whether more creative and elusive (think of perfume commercials!), or showing products the way they really are, on real people in real homes. Here, Pinterest is a great channel to explore!</span></p>
