<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">5. Entertain</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Memes make the internet go round and it’s no different for brands. For some brands, TikTok and Twitter have evolved around a persona of admin that creates fun content inspired by the product or service of their employer. This approach has clearly been successful for brands willing to take a creative risk to jump on trends, like Duolingo, Ryanair and Scrub Daddy.</span></p>
